build
# A build's record of the commit it built.
/.*-source-commit
.idea
cmake-build-debug
duckdb_unittest_tempdir/
.DS_Store
testext
test/python/__pycache__/
.Rhistory

# clangd index and compile_commands copy, written by an editor or build container.
.cache/

# DuckDB, the tree the build compiles against: `make duckdb` clones the commit duckdb.commit pins
# here, or a developer links a DuckDB tree of their own. No slash at the end, so a link is ignored too.
/duckdb
